# Disposable AcoustID backfill / audit tooling and its output. Throwaway, to be
# deleted once the catalogue is checked.
#
# Scoped to Python on purpose. The .sh files in this folder are PRODUCTION: the
# deploy workflow copies goupload-compose.sh and dangerous-guard.sh onto the
# VPS, and GoUpload/scripts/** is in the workflow's path filter. Ignoring the
# folder wholesale would break deploys.
*.py
__pycache__/
*.log
acoustid_suspects.txt
